# landmark (assets/world3d/riverbank/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Washbucket Quay: the landing stage on its piles, a quay warehouse behind the west water, a hoist crane east.
# piles standing in the water either side of the landing stage, taller as mooring posts at its corners
cylinder-6 trunk at 138 -3 22 size 6 20 6
cylinder-6 trunk at 138 -3 40 size 6 14 6
